        "pattern": "be/feel flattered by sth / to do sth / that + clause",
        "meaning_cn": "因受到赏识而高兴、感到荣幸",
        "definition_en": "to feel pleased or honoured because one is shown admiration or attention",
        "usage_note": "受到赞许的人的感受，不自动断言对方不真诚；flatter sb也可指恭维讨好，须按语境读。",
        "boundary": "受到赞许的人的感受，不自动断言对方不真诚；flatter sb也可指恭维讨好，须按语境读。",
        "direction": "R+P",
        "level": "L2"
      },
      {
